VMApple configuration DMA: map the original doorbell and normal error replies.

The original 26A434 host returns ENOTSUP for operation 2 and ENOENT for
operation 1 without optional identity data. No firmware or validation result
is changed. DMA is restricted to writable guest RAM.

diff --git a/hw/vmapple/cfg.c b/hw/vmapple/cfg.c
--- a/hw/vmapple/cfg.c
+++ b/hw/vmapple/cfg.c
@@ -14,12 +14,16 @@
 #include "hw/core/sysbus.h"
 #include "qemu/log.h"
